WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:17.334
The robot arm grasps the yellow and white mug from the table, lifts it, and places it inside the open microwave. The arm then pushes the microwave door shut.

2
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Grasp the yellow and white mug on the table

3
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Lift the mug and move it into the open microwave

4
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Release the mug inside the microwave

5
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:17.000
Push the microwave door closed
